<title>UK: Taiwan Liton exercises $6.0 mln greeshoe.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Liton exercises $6.0 mln greeshoe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan Liton Electronics Co Ltd has exercised the $6.0 million greenshoe option on its recent convertible bond, lead manager Bankers Trust International said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The total size of the issue is now $72 million.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TAIWAN LITON ELECTRONICS CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT   $72 MLN	  COUPON     0.5	 MATURITY	.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   DENOMS (K) ONE	 PREMIUM     12 PCT</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/TW/HK/SI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p>CNV PRICE  NT$102.81, CONVERSION RATIO 2,715.6891</p>
<p>FOREX FIX NT$27.92/US$</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERTIBLE FROM AUG.97 TO MAY.04</p>
<p>		CALLABLE FROM YEAR THREE SUBJECT TO 140 PCT RULE</p>
<p>		PUT OPTION YEAR FIVE AT 136.38</p>
</text>
